pipe Packets I think are in the network right now
Slow start cwnd += 1 per ACK, doubling per RTT
Congestion avoidance cwnd += 1/cwnd per ACK, +1 per RTT
AIMD Additive increase, multiplicative decrease
RTO Retransmission timeout
Karn's rule Don't take RTT samples from retransmitted
packets
